# Pairs with EventualKept in ReplicationReBootstrap. A drain whose source cut over under
# it fails, and the coordinator records the re-seed as complete instead of re-driving
# it, so the discarded copy's rows never reach s.
MODULE: EventualKeptAbortedReseedCompletes
TARGET: EventualKept
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: an aborted shadow import of s counts as a completed re-seed, so it is never re-driven
PERTURBS: AbortShadow
BOUNDS: Mutual = TRUE

--- FIND
    /\ UNCHANGED <<cid, phy, src0, dd, fellOffS, bootedS>>
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the abort marks s's re-seed complete.
    /\ bootedS' = (bootedS \/ x = s)
    /\ UNCHANGED <<cid, phy, src0, dd, fellOffS>>
--- END